          "content": "### 完整结论与代码示例\n\n#### 1. 服务注册与发现（Eureka）\n**结论**：项目使用Eureka作为服务注册中心，各模块通过心跳机制维持注册状态。\n\n**代码示例**：\n```java\n// 启动类注册\n@EnableDiscoveryClient // 关键注解\n@SpringBootApplication\npublic class ServiceApplication {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        SpringApplication.run(ServiceApplication.class, args);\n    }\n}\n\n// bootstrap.yml配置\neureka:\n  client:\n    serviceUrl:\n      defaultZone: http://eureka1:8761/eureka/,http://eureka2:8762/eureka/\n  instance:\n    leaseRenewalIntervalInSeconds: 5\n    preferIpAddress: true\n```\n\n#### 2. 服务提供者实现\n**结论**：通过Spring MVC注解暴露REST接口，注册到Eureka。\n\n**代码示例**：\n```java\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/payment\")\npublic class PaymentController {\n    \n    @Autowired\n    private PaymentService paymentService;\n\n    @PostMapping\n    public Response process(@RequestBody PaymentRequest request) {\n        // 输入验证\n        if (!validator.isValid(request)) {\n            throw new BadRequestException(\"Invalid request\");\n        }\n        return paymentService.process(request);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 3. 服务消费者实现\n**结论**：支持三种调用模式，根据场景选择最佳方式。\n\n**代码示例**：\n```java\n// 模式1：FeignClient调用（需补充依赖）\n@FeignClient(name = \"payment-service\")\npublic interface PaymentClient {\n    @PostMapping(\"/payment\")\n    Response processPayment(@RequestBody PaymentRequest request);\n}\n\n// 模式2：RestTemplate调用\n@RestController\npublic class OrderController {\n    \n    @Autowired\n    private RestTemplate restTemplate;\n\n    @PostMapping(\"/create\")\n    public Order createOrder(@RequestBody Order order) {\n        // 服务调用\n        PaymentRequest request = convert(order);\n        Response response = restTemplate.postForObject(\n            \"http://payment-service/payment\", \n            request, \n            Response.class\n        );\n        // 结果处理\n    }\n}\n\n// 模式3：水麒麟服务发现\n@EnableLookUpClient\npublic class AppConfig {}\n\n@Service\npublic class NotificationService {\n    @Autowired\n    private MailService mailService; // 通过水麒麟发现的服务\n\n    public void notifyUser() {\n        mailService.send(new MailMessage(...));\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 4. 混合调用示例\n**结论**：实际业务中常组合多种调用方式。\n\n**完整示例**：\n```java\n@Service\n@Transactional\npublic class OrderServiceImpl implements OrderService {\n    // 内部服务注入\n    @Autowired\n    private InventoryService inventoryService;\n    \n    // 外部服务代理\n    @Autowired\n    private PaymentClient paymentClient;\n    \n    // 特殊调用\n    private final BankGateway bankGateway = new BankSocketGateway();\n\n    public Order completeOrder(Order order) {\n        // 1. 检查库存（内部服务）\n        inventoryService.checkStock(order.getItems());\n        \n        // 2. 调用支付（FeignClient）\n        PaymentResponse payment = paymentClient.process(\n            new PaymentRequest(order.getId(), order.getTotal())\n        );\n        \n        // 3. 银行流水对接（Socket直连）\n        BankResponse receipt = bankGateway.submit(\n            convertToBankTransaction(payment)\n        );\n        \n        // 4. 更新订单状态\n        return orderRepository.save(\n            order.markAsPaid(payment, receipt)\n        );\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 5. 重要配置\n**结论**：这些配置关系到系统稳定性和性能。\n\n**application.yml示例**：\n```yaml\nfeign:\n  client:\n    config:\n      default:\n        connectTimeout: 5000\n        readTimeout: 30000\n        loggerLevel: basic\n\nribbon:\n  ConnectTimeout: 3000\n  ReadTimeout: 30000\n  MaxAutoRetries: 1\n```\n\n#### 架构验证建议\n1. **注册验证**：\n```bash\n# 查看Eureka注册情况\ncurl http://eureka-server:8761/eureka/apps\n```\n\n2. **调用链检查**：\n```java\n// 在Controller中添加日志\n@PostMapping\npublic Response process(@RequestBody Request request) {\n    log.info(\"Received request from {}\", \n        RequestContext.getCurrentContext().get(\"X-Service-Name\"));\n    // ...\n}\n```\n\n3. **超时测试**：\n```java\n@Test\npublic void testTimeoutScenario() {\n    assertThatThrownBy(() -> {\n        paymentClient.process(createSlowRequest(60000)); // 60s超时请求\n    }).isInstanceOf(FeignException.class);\n}\n```\n\n是否需要我：\n1. 提供特定模块的完整调用链路分析？\n2. 展示性能监控配置？\n3. 解释事务传播机制的实际应用？",
